  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together lime juice, olive oil, garlic powder, paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the minced chicken liver to the bowl and mix well.",
    "Thread the chicken breast onto the skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Brush the skewers with the marinade, making sure they're evenly coated.",
    "Grill the skewers for 8-10 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "Let the skewers rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
